\bibitem{darweesh2024initial}
C.~L. Darweesh \emph{et~al.}, ``Initial prototyping of a low-cost unoccupied
  ground vehicle platform for crop problem risk and severity mapping in
  agricultural fields,'' in \emph{Autonomous Air and Ground Sensing Systems for
  Agricultural Optimization and Phenotyping IX}, vol. 13475.\hskip 1em plus
  0.5em minus 0.4em\relax SPIE, 2024, p. 134750I, demonstrates the direct
  application of an ArduPilot Pixhawk flight controller to modify an RC car
  into a functional UGV.

\bibitem{castro2024heterogeneous}
L.~Castro \emph{et~al.}, ``Heterogeneous multi-robot collaboration for coverage
  path planning in partially known dynamic environments,'' \emph{Machines},
  vol.~12, no.~3, p. 200, 2024, highlights the necessity of shared control
  architectures for UAV and UGV cooperation.

\bibitem{silva2019implementation}
G.~Silva, ``Implementation of an autopilot for uav/ugv systems based on android
  smartphone,'' Master's thesis, Politecnico di Torino, 2019, discusses the
  integration of autopilot logic, middleware, and standard microcontroller
  hardware for cross-domain vehicles.

